cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived software release."
type: software
title: "VTutor v10.2.1 Vstable (block_ai_tutor): a Moodle block for AI-supported conversational tutoring"
abstract: >-
  VTutor is a Moodle block that provides AI-supported conversational tutoring
  inside courses. Version 10.2.1 Vstable, Moodle build 2026022203, preserves the
  technical-stabilization artifact frozen on 22 February 2026. The release
  documents functional stabilization and operational governance; it does not
  claim pedagogical effectiveness, independent replication, or a
  production-validated advanced retrieval-augmented generation system.
